+/*
+ * Per-source calibration for the raw-bayer PIX path.  msm8939 routes both
+ * cameras through this single VFE's PIX line and the media controller
+ * decides at arm time which ISPIF line feeds it: "msm_ispif0" = rear
+ * (CSIPHY0/CSID0/OV13850), "msm_ispif1" = front (CSIPHY1/CSID1/OV5693).
+ * The sensors need different gain sets (OV5693 white-wall calibration
+ * 260/128/163 from r89) and the OV13850 TL84 colour matrix over-corrects
+ * the OV5693 (identity matrix there), so the armed link has to pick which
+ * set vfe_set_*_cfg() actually programs.  Only the sensor-dependent knobs
+ * are per-line; pix_full_isp/ce/interp/blc stay shared (both cameras run
+ * the same B2 pipeline).  All values remain runtime-tunable like the
+ * shared set, and stream-on latches them.
